; form-cli-heedmark-band.fk — the model marks; the carrier heeds.
;
; A heedmark is a Form-native execution token. The model writes it into its own
; output as ordinary text; the carrier recognizes it, Form looks the query up,
; and the answer re-enters as prefill at the current position.
;
; THE STANDING REFUSAL, and bit 1 is exactly this: LogitsExecuted = 0. A forward
; pass produces a distribution over ids and nothing else. No logit executed a
; tool, here or anywhere. The model asked; the carrier answered.
;
; PROOF LEVEL: this cell is pure arithmetic and string folds over the lowered
; xtal — no host organ, no GPU, no file organ beyond read_file for the authority
; text. It is therefore a candidate for a four-arm run and is NOT claimed as one
; here: the four-arm gate is owned by validate.sh, which is red on this checkout
; for a reason that predates this band (bootstrap uni.c stale, fourth arm ABSENT).
; What is witnessed below is the fkwu arm.
;
; Verdict 1023:
;   1     LogitsExecuted is 0 — the standing refusal
;   2     four outcomes reachable and distinct (hit/miss/nothing/spent)
;   4     spent is the only unheeded outcome — nothing was still attempted
;   8     a span enters for hit and miss; never for nothing or spent
;   16    knowledge only on a hit, and a hit with no source is refused
;   32    bounded — 5 marks under MaxHeeds=2 honor exactly 2
;   64    the prefix seam — cost is the span, not the prefix
;   128   the marks are distinct and the span texts are the named ones
;   256   class descriptor FormHeedmark minted (generic T)
;   512   high-grammar authority has package/interface/class/const/template
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/language-template.fk
; preludes: form-stdlib/form-cli-heedmark-xtal.fk
; witnessed: 2026-08-24 -> 1023 on fkwu; bounded(5)=2, forwards-saved(1000,12)=1000

(do
    (defn fhmb-has-str? (s needle)
        (if (ge (str_find s needle 0) 0) 1 0))
    (defn fhmb-has-name? (xs name)
        (if (nil? xs) 0
            (if (str_eq (head xs) name) 1
                (fhmb-has-name? (tail xs) name))))

    (let bits (fhm-check))
    (let desc (FormHeedmark))
    (let src (read_file "form/form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-heedmark.bml"))
    (let b8 (if (and (str_eq (nth desc 1) "FormHeedmark")
                     (and (eq (fhmb-has-name? (nth desc 2) "T") 1)
                          (and (eq (fhmb-has-name? (nth desc 3) "fhm-outcome") 1)
                               (and (eq (fhmb-has-name? (nth desc 3) "fhm-bounded") 1)
                                    (eq (fhmb-has-name? (nth desc 4) "LogitsExecuted") 1)))))
                256 0))
    (let b9 (if (and (eq (fhmb-has-str? src "package Form.cli.heedmark") 1)
                     (and (eq (fhmb-has-str? src "interface IHeedmark") 1)
                          (and (eq (fhmb-has-str? src "class FormHeedmark") 1)
                               (and (eq (fhmb-has-str? src "const int LogitsExecuted") 1)
                                    (eq (fhmb-has-str? src "template HeedRequest") 1)))))
                512 0))
    (add bits (add b8 b9)))
